{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>警方正通緝一名男子，涉嫌掌摑兒子。<br/></p><p>據了解，涉事的10歲男童周日因拒絕溫習，其53歲父親掌摑他的面及手。男童23歲姐姐目睹事件，之後轉述予男童學校社工，再由社工報警。男童之後送往伊利沙伯醫院留醫接受治療。據了解，警方仍正約見受害人，在成人陪同下錄取口供。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T07:00:17.377026+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T06:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T07:17:45.472384+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T06:57:41.217168+00:00","content_hash":"903ff9df4f3392a353dbeac1ce2ac3f251f12f53a87b18f0c51cd21c4b40a450","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}